  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h2><span><strong>INFRIUM Creator Program</strong></span></h2><p><span><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0965/0022/0271/files/influencer.png?v=1776512736\" style=\"width:503px;max-width:100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"influencer.png?v=1776512736\"></strong></span><br></p><p><strong>About our brand and products:</strong></p><p><br>INFRIUM is a premium wellness brand specializing in high-end infrared saunas and cold plunge systems designed for recovery, performance, and daily health routines. Our products are used by homeowners, fitness enthusiasts, and wellness-focused individuals across the US and Canada who want to bring professional-level recovery into their home.</p><hr><p><strong>What makes us different:</strong></p><p><br>• High-ticket products ($8,000–$22,000+) with real earning potential<br>• Premium positioning — not mass-market or low-quality products<br>• Strong demand in the fast-growing wellness and recovery space<br>• Clean, modern branding that converts well with content</p><hr><p><strong>How creators earn:</strong></p><p><br>• Earn <strong>8% commission per sale</strong><br>• Typical earnings: <strong>$600 – $1,700+ per conversion</strong><br>• 30-day cookie window<br>• Monthly payouts with full tracking dashboard</p><p>You don’t need high volume, just a few conversions can generate significant income.</p><hr><p><strong>How to promote INFRIUM:</strong></p><p><br>• Share your <strong>unique affiliate link or discount code</strong><br>• Create content on TikTok, Instagram, X, Facebook, or YouTube<br>• Use our product images, videos, or lifestyle content<br>• Focus on wellness, recovery, fitness, or lifestyle angles</p><p>You do <strong>not need to own the product</strong> to start.</p><hr><p><strong>Who we’re looking for:</strong></p><p><br>We’re actively looking for <strong>driven, health-focused creators</strong> who:</p><p><br>• Are passionate about fitness, recovery, or wellness<br>• Enjoy creating engaging content<br>• Want to build long-term brand partnerships<br>• Are ready to earn from premium products</p><p>Our main customer base is in the <strong>United States and Canada</strong>, so audiences in these regions perform best.</p><hr><p><strong>Why join INFRIUM:</strong></p><p><br>This is not typical low-commission affiliate marketing.<br>We offer a <strong>long-term creator partnership</strong> with high payouts, premium products, and real growth potential.</p></div>",
